[00:13.91]Read the article about Chinese animation and learn about its history.阅读关于中国动画的文章，了解其发展历史。
[00:20.92]Chinese animation: from shadow puppets to 3D films.中国动画：从皮影戏到3D电影。
[00:28.15]Chinese animation has a history of more than 100 years.中国动画已有超过100年的历史。
[00:34.21]This art form combines modern technology with traditional art techniques, such as paper cutting, shadow puppet performances and ink wash painting.这种艺术形式将现代技术与传统艺术手法相结合，如剪纸、皮影戏和水墨画。
[00:47.60]Films in this style often contain many themes from Chinese art, literature and culture.这种风格的电影通常包含许多来自中国艺术、文学和文化的主题。
[00:55.92]Piggy Eats Watermelon (1958) was the first paper-cut animation.《小猪吃西瓜》（1958年）是中国第一部剪纸动画。
[01:03.59]In this groundbreaking short film, Zhu Bajie and the other characters come to life on screen, just like shadow puppets.在这部具有开创性的短片中，猪八戒和其他角色在银幕上栩栩如生，就像皮影戏一样。
[01:13.96]The film amazed audiences across China with its bright colors and lively animation style.这部电影以其鲜艳的色彩和生动的动画风格惊艳了全中国的观众。
[01:21.88]Two years later, another important breakthrough came with the first ink wash animated film: Baby Tadpoles Look for Their Mother.两年后，中国第一部水墨动画电影《小蝌蚪找妈妈》问世，实现了又一重要突破。
[01:32.85]This short film was influenced by the famous artist Qi Baishi, and it looks exactly like a traditional ink painting.这部短片受著名画家齐白石的影响，看起来就像一幅传统的水墨画。
[01:42.82]The film was very successful and won several national and international awards.这部电影大获成功，斩获了多项国内外奖项。
[01:49.24]Besides traditional art techniques, Chinese animated films also reflect traditional Chinese culture.除了传统艺术手法，中国动画电影还体现了中国传统文化。
[01:58.57]Ancient stories are a common theme, and it is no surprise that the much-loved characters from the adventure novel Journey to the West often appear in animation.古代故事是常见的主题，而深受喜爱的武侠小说《西游记》中的角色经常出现在动画中，这并不令人意外。
[02:11.75]Havoc in Heaven (1961) tells the story of the Monkey King and is perhaps the most famous Chinese animated film.《大闹天宫》（1961年）讲述了孙悟空的故事，或许是中国最著名的动画电影。
[02:22.81]It combines traditional Chinese painting techniques with the sound effects from Beijing Opera.它将中国传统绘画技巧与京剧音效相结合。
[02:30.22]Today, Chinese animators continue to explore new methods of filmmaking.如今，中国动画人仍在不断探索新的电影制作方式。
[02:38.04]Films like Monkey King: Hero Is Back were made with advanced 3D animation software.《大圣归来》等电影采用了先进的3D动画软件制作。
[02:46.28]With the help of the latest computer technology, such as artificial intelligence (AI), filmmakers are bringing the heroes from classic Chinese stories into the 21st century.在人工智能（AI）等最新计算机技术的助力下，电影人正将中国经典故事中的英雄人物带入21世纪。

